<tr><td>Tile, slate, or specialty</td><td>Material availability, matching, specialty labor, and underlayment</td></tr>
<tr><td>Low-slope commercial</td><td>Wet insulation, cover board, edge metal, coping, curbs, rooftop HVAC unit damage, and crane or access costs</td></tr>
<tr><td>Accessories</td><td>Gutters, downspouts, vents, chimney caps and flashing, skylights, and solar panel detach and reset</td></tr>
</tbody>
